{"channelId":"UCOt1Xt9J_3Vap9_7PiLIZfw","row":["Nicole -That London Therapist",67,"Hi! I'm Nicole and I'm a complementary health therapist based in Chelsea, London. I specialise in reflexology treatments, therapeutic and deep tissue massage, and circulo-lymphatic massage. I suffer from scoliosis and therefore chronic back pain.  I decided to try the viral Chinese exercises as they are meant to help with releasing fascia, stimulating circulation and lymphatic flow, and helping with stress reduction. So far I have seen a vast improvement in my back pain and leg heaviness and discomfort ( I have varicose veins). I have also noticed that my energy levels have improved. I would definitely encourage you to start doing these exercises daily which only take about 8 minutes(please check with your doctor before starting any exercises). \nPlease follow my instagram @thatlondontherapist for more exercises and self care inspiration. Please send me a DM on instagram if you would like to see me for a reflexology treatment or a massage. Take care of yourself, Nicole","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOt1Xt9J_3Vap9_7PiLIZfw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOt1Xt9J_3Vap9_7PiLIZfw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:11:16.435Z","channelId":"UCOt1Xt9J_3Vap9_7PiLIZfw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"9631d5c94ce45b13119669e2514f47d914f77f09e87ceb77fdaa2f40e62949a3","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"207f17d3f770e8dbf6defe5c88090282ffc344388c2b7aa38a3a917ed6902e7b"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOt1Xt9J_3Vap9_7PiLIZfw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":67,"raw":"67 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOt1Xt9J_3Vap9_7PiLIZfw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:11:16.435Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"massage therap